{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_093_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "0c84af0b0da8c722edca232237cbdafa9ed8fc648982311ccf9a354e7c2347de", "ja": "歩さん、なんだかご機嫌ですね～。\nなにかいいことでも\nあったんですか～？", "zh": "步小姐，感觉心情很好呢～  \n是遇到什么好事了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_093_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "229f5bba4d75900f7772662e3c2e5f5a00eece346fc6e36b48528c71a5549d7c", "ja": "へへっ、わかる？\n実は……今日、ボイトレの先生に\nほめられちゃってさ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，看得出来吗？\n其实……今天被声乐训练老师夸奖了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_093_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6020502979333bf288bee5d3c3b69a987a0a44209a4d2382150cbf69b4beef24", "ja": "しっかり上達したね、だってさ！\nアタシの特技に、歌が追加される\n日も近いかな～。なんて♪", "zh": "老师还夸我说：“进步很明显呢！”\n看来我很快就要把唱歌也加入特长里了吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_093_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "fcd52d0ffaf8c282c214a0d8f231af6f414568ae97b447cee3cf68a5654ced40", "ja": "おお……すごい自信！\n最初、「歌は苦手だよ～！」って\n言ってた歩とは思えない進化だね！", "zh": "哦……真是自信满满啊！\n真没想到你就是那个一开始还说“我不擅长唱歌啦～！”的步，进步得真大呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_093_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "be145b2624d3e69121705c0000da9b15f9c371bce90bce8798128502f3ce9b53", "ja": "自信がついたのは、\nとってもいいことですよ～。\n歩さんの新曲、楽しみですな～。", "zh": "能建立起自信，真是太好了～。\n我很期待步的新歌呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
